Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Header,,0,0,0,,This is a Gentlemen of the Hàn free fansub.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.40,0:00:06.32,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,880,5000,5920)\pos(640,337.553)}Episode 83
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.40,0:00:06.32,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,880,5000,5920)\pos(640,515.788)}Sneaking Through Yinping
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.90,0:00:38.42,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(875.932,484.068)}Zhōng Huì\NStyled: Shìjì
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.18,0:00:44.20,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,4780,5060)\pos(1002.034,492.203)}Dèng Ài\NStyled: Shìzǎi
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.84,0:00:42.30,Default,Deng Zhong,0,0,0,,Father, to be petty is to ruin the greater good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.30,0:00:45.44,Default,Deng Zhong,0,0,0,,Discord among us before war will jeopardize matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.44,0:00:47.81,Default,Deng Zhong,0,0,0,,Father, I hope you will tolerate this for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.99,0:00:51.45,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,We invite the General-who-Conquers-the-West!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.52,0:00:58.02,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,Conquering General!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.45,0:01:00.37,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,Please...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.78,0:01:09.68,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Shiji, I heard that you command your army well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.68,0:01:13.44,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Seeing this now, that is indeed the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.91,0:01:17.57,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,General, you are being too kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.97,0:01:32.58,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Rumor has it that Zhuge Liang appeared\N in a dream to you at Mount Dingjun, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.34,0:01:40.63,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Thus, you set up this white flag to\N warn your army not to kill any civilians.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.63,0:01:43.05,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Is this true?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.00,0:01:46.22,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,Indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.22,0:01:49.45,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,My army has marched as if cutting through bamboo,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.45,0:01:51.97,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,the locals in awe and welcoming us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.97,0:01:57.04,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,Seeing this, Chengdu will certainly be taken soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.71,0:02:03.34,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,No wonder you have achieved such a great feat, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.34,0:02:07.55,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,It is like Zhuge Liang's spirit is giving you advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.16,0:02:31.09,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.52,0:02:44.49,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.70,0:03:02.13,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,General, your taking of Hanzhong\N is truly the court's great fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.26,0:03:06.36,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,However, there is still the mighty Jiange Pass ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.36,0:03:10.55,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Jiang Wei guards it, so I fear that it cannot be taken quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.39,0:03:16.75,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,Jiange is the gateway to the Riverlands, and it is treacherous and steep.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.75,0:03:19.90,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,General, would you have a plan to defeat the enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.89,0:03:25.01,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Jiange's terrain is indeed treacherous:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.01,0:03:28.09,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,it is easy to defend and difficult to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.86,0:03:31.38,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,General, you know geography well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.38,0:03:33.10,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,Surely you have a brilliant idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.10,0:03:35.41,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,I dare not, I dare not.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.41,0:03:37.66,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,General, no need to be overly modest.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.89,0:03:44.38,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,Please, General, give me frank advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.23,0:03:51.62,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,I believe that a force could go\N through the Yinping small path,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.62,0:03:54.94,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,out of Hanzhong's Deyang Precinct \Nto capture Chengdu directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.19,0:03:57.94,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Jiang Wei would then withdraw to rescue it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.94,0:04:02.90,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,General, you can then seize the \Nchance to take Jiange and win the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.12,0:04:16.21,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,General, your thoughts?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.21,0:04:21.04,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,A brilliant idea, what a brilliant idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.28,0:04:25.73,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,Please, General, lead the troops out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.73,0:04:28.65,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,I shall await your report of victory right here, General.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.65,0:04:29.41,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.00,0:04:33.65,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.45,0:04:54.69,Thinking,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,They all say that Deng Shizai is full of wits and plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.69,0:04:57.28,Thinking,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,Today, I see that he is just a mediocre man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.55,0:05:03.52,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,The Yinping path is deep inside\N high mountains and steep hills.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.52,0:05:10.05,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,If the Shu army defends that place with around \Na hundred men and blocks his path of retreat,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.05,0:05:13.11,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,then Deng Ai's troops will all starve to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.93,0:05:18.48,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,I shall move on the main road.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.48,0:05:23.68,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,Now that we are here, Jiange's fall is imminent.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.68,0:05:26.46,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,Why worry that Shu will not be destroyed?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.60,0:05:29.93,Default,Generals,0,0,0,,- Indeed, General.\N- Well calculated, General.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.16,0:05:38.90,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Zhong,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.52,0:05:41.10,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,how did Zhong Hui treat me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.76,0:05:43.90,Default,Deng Zhong,0,0,0,,I think he was superficially polite.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.95,0:05:48.46,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,I was truly being sincere to him,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.46,0:05:50.90,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,yet he treated me as if I were a mediocre man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.20,0:05:53.40,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Now that he took Hanzhong,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.40,0:05:56.04,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,he thinks that there is no greater merit than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.68,0:05:59.38,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Without my presence in \NTazhong to pin Jiang Wei down,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.38,0:06:00.90,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,how could he have succeeded?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.38,0:06:09.01,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Zhong Hui expects that I cannot \Ntake Chengdu, but I will show him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.81,0:06:26.72,Default,Officer,0,0,0,,General, Deng Ai left camp and heads for Yinping.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.72,0:06:29.01,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Seven hundred {\i1}li{\i0} is about 350 kilometers or 218 miles.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.72,0:06:29.01,Default,Officer,0,0,0,,He camps seven hundred{\i1} li{\i0} away from Jiange.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.55,0:06:31.38,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,Orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.29,0:06:35.64,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,Attack Jiange at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.64,0:06:36.65,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.37,0:07:24.36,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Soldiers, my mind is made up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.36,0:07:28.46,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,We will sneak through the\N Yinping path and seize Chengdu directly!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.00,0:07:33.30,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Should we succeed, we'll attain\N an unparalleled accomplishment!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.30,0:07:35.73,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Will you all accompany me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.73,0:07:50.42,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,At your command! Death won't stop me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.04,0:07:51.66,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Deng Zhong!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.06,0:07:52.84,Default,Deng Zhong,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.84,0:07:54.25,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,You are the vanguard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.25,0:07:57.74,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,As you trek, cut through mountains, \Nand build bridges and pavilions!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.74,0:07:58.24,Default,Deng Zhong,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.59,0:08:07.80,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Depart at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.80,0:08:08.33,Default,Deng Zhong,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.16,0:08:42.65,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Go! Keep up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.44,0:10:45.18,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.49,0:10:57.36,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Don't look back!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.82,0:11:17.46,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Come...reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.08,0:11:24.62,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Hold tight!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.43,0:12:52.54,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,In the winter of the fourth year of the Jingyuan era of Wei, 263 CE,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.54,0:12:56.32,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Conquering General Deng Ai led thirty thousand men
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.32,0:12:59.54,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,to march through the Yinping path.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.54,0:13:02.02,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,After undergoing innumerable dangers,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.02,0:13:05.58,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,spending over twenty days, \Nmarching seven hundred {\i0}li{\i1},
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.58,0:13:09.43,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,and making more than ten camps along the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.43,0:13:15.58,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,around two thousand remaining soldiers arrived in front of Motian Ridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.68,0:13:36.47,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.67,0:14:37.50,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.58,0:15:17.37,Default,Deng Zhong,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.50,0:15:20.39,Default,Deng Zhong,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.00,0:15:32.29,Default,Deng Zhong,0,0,0,,Hold on. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.06,0:15:49.98,Default,Deng Zhong,0,0,0,,Hold on tight!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.51,0:16:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Chancellor Zhuge, Marquis Wu, inscribes:
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.49,0:16:14.90,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Two fires: 火 + 火 = 炎; rise: 興\NIt was the {\u1}first{\u0} year of the Yanxing era [炎興].
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.49,0:16:14.89,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"When two fires first rise, one man shall cross."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.90,0:16:18.18,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Gentlemen: Shi [士].\NDeng Ai was styled Shizai [士載].\NZhong Hui was styled Shiji [士季].
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.89,0:16:18.18,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"When two gentlemen contend, both shall soon die."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.14,0:16:22.52,Default,General,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}A medicine farmer in the mountains encountered this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.52,0:16:25.05,Default,General,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}This tablet was erected by Zhuge Liang.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.05,0:16:27.16,Default,General,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}There is still an empty camp below Motian Ridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.16,0:16:30.71,Default,General,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Zhuge Liang deployed a thousand soldiers \Nto defend it when he lived.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.71,0:16:32.99,Default,General,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Now, it has been abandoned by Liu Shan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.52,0:16:42.80,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}He was truly a marvelous man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.26,0:16:49.19,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Yet I could not serve him as a student. A pity! A pity!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.69,0:16:54.45,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,We've suffered for nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.45,0:16:56.28,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,All for nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.28,0:17:00.54,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,This Motian Ridge can't be passed!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.41,0:17:07.09,Default,Deng Zhong,0,0,0,,Father, there are only cliffs and \Nrock faces to the west. There is no path!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.75,0:17:34.73,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,We have marched over seven hundred {\i1}li {\i0}to get here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.73,0:17:38.39,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,There is only the way to come here, and no way back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.39,0:17:43.10,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Only by pressing forward will there be a path to life!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.10,0:17:46.10,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Beyond this ridge lies Jiangyou!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.10,0:17:48.90,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Victory is before us; how can we withdraw?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.16,0:18:32.08,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}What divine might, General!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.08,0:18:35.70,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}We shall win! We will obey orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.70,0:18:40.68,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}We will not falter even with ten thousand deaths!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.68,0:18:45.84,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Soldiers! If you do not enter the \Ntiger's lair, how will you get the tiger's son?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.84,0:18:48.58,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Beyond this mountain lies Jiangyou!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.58,0:18:52.07,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,When the deed is done, we will share glory and riches!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.07,0:18:56.35,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,As you command, General!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.35,0:18:57.93,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Send the weapons down first!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.59,0:19:27.63,Default,Deng Zhong,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.26,0:19:31.29,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,General!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.30,0:19:54.59,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Men.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.36,0:19:57.13,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Let us celebrate beneath the mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.76,0:20:07.17,Default,Deng Zhong,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.17,0:20:08.85,Default,Deng Zhong,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.69,0:21:09.71,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,General, I'm still alive....
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.71,0:21:14.26,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,I'm still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.20,0:21:16.56,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,I'm still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.31,0:21:22.84,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,We're still alive...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.84,0:21:23.74,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.96,0:21:27.18,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Brother! Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.32,0:23:20.14,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Onto Jiangyou!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.77,0:23:24.74,Default,Liu Shan,0,0,0,,Deng Ai has descended from the sky...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.74,0:23:27.85,Default,Liu Shan,0,0,0,,He has already passed Fucheng...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.74,0:23:31.29,Default,Liu Shan,0,0,0,,And Chengdu is defenseless!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.94,0:23:36.86,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,3580,3900)\pos(962.735,455.322)}Liú Shàn\NStyled: Gōngsì
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.79,0:23:35.18,Default,Liu Shan,0,0,0,,Oh, what to do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.23,0:23:38.38,Default,Liu Shan,0,0,0,,Oh, what to do now!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.01,0:23:45.20,Default,Xi Zheng,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, summon Zhuge Zhan, son \Nof Zhuge Liang, to lead a desperate defense!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.26,0:23:45.26,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,3620,3980)\pos(991.186,480)}Xī Zhèng\NStyled: Lìngxiān
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.98,0:23:47.61,Default,Liu Shan,0,0,0,,Yes, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.08,0:23:51.54,Default,Liu Shan,0,0,0,,Summon Zhuge Zhan and his son \Nto lead troops to the defense now!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.42,0:24:07.66,Default,General,0,0,0,,General, Zhuge Kongming is not dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.66,0:24:08.90,Default,General,0,0,0,,We are doomed!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.62,0:24:13.40,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(977.672,441.966)}Zhūgě Zhān\NStyled: Sīyuǎn
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.74,0:24:16.22,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2100,2460)\pos(364.746,218.305)}Zhūgě Shàng
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.79,0:24:15.94,Default,Zhuge Shang,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.26,0:24:29.16,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.99,0:24:49.78,Default,Zhuge Shang,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.17,0:24:56.29,Default,Zhuge Zhan,0,0,0,,Shang!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.15,0:25:06.06,Default,Zhuge Shang,0,0,0,,Father...Fa...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.58,0:25:08.58,Default,Zhuge Zhan,0,0,0,,Shang!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.04,0:25:46.20,Default,Zhuge Zhan,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}We, three generations of the Zhuge Clan,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.20,0:25:48.52,Default,Zhuge Zhan,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}have received favor from the empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.04,0:25:51.42,Default,Zhuge Zhan,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Today, I die to repay the late emperor!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.29,0:26:07.86,Default,Zhuge Zhan,0,0,0,,Shang...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.98,0:26:52.30,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}The Zhuge father and son are true martyrs.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.24,0:27:30.90,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Attack Chengdu at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.64,0:27:34.83,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Deng Ai, sneaking through Yinping,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.83,0:27:39.05,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,took Jiangyou, seized Fucheng, and attacked Mianzhu.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.05,0:27:42.45,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,His army quickly closed in on Chengdu.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.14,0:27:47.25,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,The Lord of Shu, Liu Shan, panicked at the news.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.25,0:27:50.63,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,He summoned his officials to discuss countermeasures.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.63,0:27:52.20,Default,Officials,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.20,0:27:52.90,Default,Military Official,0,0,0,,Your Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.90,0:27:55.40,Default,Military Official,0,0,0,,we are outnumbered and resistance is difficult!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.40,0:27:58.23,Default,Military Official,0,0,0,,Flee Chengdu for the seven Nanzhong commanderies!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.23,0:27:59.88,Default,Civil Official,0,0,0,,An excellent suggestion!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.88,0:28:04.24,Default,Civil Official,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, Nanzhong is hard to traverse, easy to attack from and hold!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.24,0:28:07.09,Default,Civil Official,0,0,0,,We can borrow its troops and reclaim our lost land!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.09,0:28:08.22,Default,Qiao Zhou,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.22,0:28:09.90,Default,Qiao Zhou,0,0,0,,The Southern troops are capricious.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.54,0:28:10.90,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,1940,2340)\pos(1002.034,435.254)}Qiáo Zhōu\NStyled: Yǔnnán
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.90,0:28:11.84,Default,Qiao Zhou,0,0,0,,Your Majesty has not favored them.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.84,0:28:15.74,Default,Qiao Zhou,0,0,0,,If you go to them, doom will be certain!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.74,0:28:17.06,Default,Military Officials,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.06,0:28:18.85,Default,Military Official Two,0,0,0,,As Shu and Wu are allies,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.85,0:28:21.25,Default,Military Official Two,0,0,0,,we can take refuge in Wu away from danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.25,0:28:22.83,Default,All,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.83,0:28:24.49,Default,All,0,0,0,,Your Majesty...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.49,0:28:26.46,Default,Qiao Zhou,0,0,0,,{\bord8\pos(640,660)}A grave mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.46,0:28:28.89,Default,Qiao Zhou,0,0,0,,{\bord8\pos(640,660)}Your Majesty, since ancient times,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.89,0:28:31.94,Default,Qiao Zhou,0,0,0,,{\bord8\pos(640,660)}not a single sovereign sheltered in a foreign state.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.94,0:28:34.70,Default,Qiao Zhou,0,0,0,,{\bord8\pos(640,660)}In my view, Wei can annex Wu,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.70,0:28:36.70,Default,Qiao Zhou,0,0,0,,{\bord8\pos(640,660)}but Wu cannot destroy Wei.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.70,0:28:39.86,Default,Qiao Zhou,0,0,0,,{\bord8\pos(640,660)}Swearing fealty to Wu would be the first disgrace.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.86,0:28:42.19,Default,Qiao Zhou,0,0,0,,{\bord8\pos(640,660)}Should Wu be conquered by Wei,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.19,0:28:44.96,Default,Qiao Zhou,0,0,0,,{\bord8\pos(640,660)}then Your Majesty would have to swear fealty to Wei;
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.96,0:28:47.08,Default,Qiao Zhou,0,0,0,,{\bord8\pos(640,660)}this would be the second disgrace.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.08,0:28:48.22,Default,Qiao Zhou,0,0,0,,{\bord8\pos(640,660)}In my opinion,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.22,0:28:50.36,Default,Qiao Zhou,0,0,0,,{\bord8\pos(640,660)}it is better to surrender to Wei!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.96,0:28:53.18,Default,Qiao Zhou,0,0,0,,{\bord8\pos(640,660)}Wei would give a portion of land to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.18,0:28:55.34,Default,Qiao Zhou,0,0,0,,{\bord8\pos(640,660)}safeguarding the ancestral temples
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.34,0:28:58.11,Default,Qiao Zhou,0,0,0,,{\bord8\pos(640,660)}and protecting the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.11,0:29:00.72,Default,Qiao Zhou,0,0,0,,{\bord8\pos(640,660)}Your Majesty, do consider this carefully!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.37,0:29:02.40,Default,Liu Shan,0,0,0,,That...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.40,0:29:04.34,Default,Officials,0,0,0,,N-No... No! \NAbsolutely not...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.34,0:29:07.90,Default,Officials,0,0,0,,We cannot surrender to Wei...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.90,0:29:09.01,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.01,0:29:10.27,Default,Officials,0,0,0,,We cannot surrender...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.08,0:29:14.18,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,Cowardly and corrupt charlatans!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.18,0:29:16.38,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,You dare to discuss matters of state?!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.10,0:29:20.82,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,Since ancient times, has there been a Son of Heaven who surrendered?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.50,0:29:27.08,Default,Liu Shan,0,0,0,,Son, all the officials advise surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.08,0:29:28.94,Default,Liu Shan,0,0,0,,Only you are acting impulsively.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.94,0:29:33.70,Default,Liu Shan,0,0,0,,Do you want Chengdu razed to nothing but ashes?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.70,0:29:36.65,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,Imperial Father, when the late emperor still lived,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.58,0:29:39.02,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,3140,3420)\pos(962.712,250.847)}Liú Chén
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.65,0:29:39.02,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,Qiao Zhou never participated in state affairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.02,0:29:41.54,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,Now he inserts himself into them to spout nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.54,0:29:42.80,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,How absurd!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.48,0:29:48.19,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,We have tens of thousands of soldiers at Chengdu.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.19,0:29:50.06,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,Jiang Wei's entire army is at Jiange.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.06,0:29:51.55,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,When he learns of our peril,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.55,0:29:55.22,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,a two-front counterattack by us can secure victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.58,0:29:57.98,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,How can you heed these corrupt liars
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.98,0:30:00.32,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,and abandon the late emperor's legacy?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.32,0:30:01.54,Default,Liu Shan,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.54,0:30:04.07,Default,Liu Shan,0,0,0,,You know nothing of destiny, witless child!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.83,0:30:06.06,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,Imperial Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.09,0:30:13.94,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,Even when all is lost,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.94,0:30:18.20,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,we, father and son, lord and subject,\N should live and die for the state!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.30,0:30:20.87,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,Should we surrender,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.87,0:30:24.52,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,how could we face the late emperor after we die?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.09,0:30:26.24,Default,Liu Shan,0,0,0,,Nonsense...!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.57,0:30:27.46,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,Imperial Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.46,0:30:28.39,Default,Liu Shan,0,0,0,,Nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.16,0:30:32.57,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,Imperial Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.57,0:30:33.09,Default,Liu Shan,0,0,0,,Nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.09,0:30:34.34,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,Imperial Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.78,0:30:36.80,Default,Liu Shan,0,0,0,,Nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.74,0:30:43.67,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,Imperial Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.34,0:30:47.01,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,Your son, Liu Chen...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.44,0:30:49.96,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,shall never surrender!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.38,0:30:53.63,Default,Liu Shan,0,0,0,,Get him out of the palace!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.45,0:30:56.59,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,Imperial Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.59,0:30:59.12,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,Do not surrender!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.93,0:31:02.52,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,Imperial Father, do not surrender!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.52,0:31:04.43,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,We must not betray our ancestors!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.43,0:31:07.42,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,We must not shame our posterity!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.42,0:31:10.94,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,Imperial Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.96,0:31:14.35,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,You pedantic recreants!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.35,0:31:16.41,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,You are ruining the Late Emperor's legacy!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.41,0:31:18.20,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,You will be punished by Heaven!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.20,0:31:24.75,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,Imperial Father! Do not surrender!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.78,0:31:30.05,Default,Liu Shan,0,0,0,,Draft the instrument of surrender!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.26,0:31:36.24,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2580,2980)\pos(982.857,480)}Chéngdū
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.56,0:31:53.09,Default,Qiao Zhou,0,0,0,,Chengdu, with its 280,000 families, \N940,000 men and women,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.09,0:31:56.54,Default,Qiao Zhou,0,0,0,,110,000 armored soldiers,\N 40,000 officials and magistrates,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.54,0:31:58.34,Default,Qiao Zhou,0,0,0,,more than 400,000 bushels of grain,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.34,0:32:00.25,Default,Qiao Zhou,0,0,0,,2,000 catties each of gold and silver,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.25,0:32:02.72,Default,Qiao Zhou,0,0,0,,200,000 pieces of brocade,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.72,0:32:04.75,Default,Qiao Zhou,0,0,0,,and other uncountable treasures,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.75,0:32:06.50,Default,Qiao Zhou,0,0,0,,with its lord and officials,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.50,0:32:09.56,Default,Qiao Zhou,0,0,0,,shall, on the first day of the twelfth month, surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.27,0:32:33.66,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,Surrender?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.68,0:32:36.27,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,Surrender?!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.52,0:32:38.37,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,They all surrendered?!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.93,0:32:44.42,Default,Lady Cui,0,0,0,,Husband, why you are angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.66,0:32:48.82,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,The Wei army is at the gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.30,0:32:52.56,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,My father has drafted his surrender,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.56,0:32:55.40,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,and all the officials left the city to surrender!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.86,0:32:58.30,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2060,2420)\pos(282.034,425.424)}Lady Cuī
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.02,0:33:01.68,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,The spirits of the nation have collapsed!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.08,0:33:04.18,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.31,0:33:11.38,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,I would rather die and go see the Late Emperor!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.48,0:33:17.12,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,I will never bend my knees and be humiliated!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.53,0:33:22.54,Default,Lady Cui,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.21,0:33:25.25,Default,Lady Cui,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.38,0:33:29.44,Default,Lady Cui,0,0,0,,You are a wise husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.41,0:33:33.64,Default,Lady Cui,0,0,0,,This is a proper death.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.04,0:33:36.25,Default,Lady Cui,0,0,0,,My husband,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.85,0:33:40.62,Default,Lady Cui,0,0,0,,your wife asks to die first.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.25,0:33:43.78,Default,Lady Cui,0,0,0,,It will not be too late for you to die later.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.97,0:33:45.84,Default,Sons,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.27,0:33:53.76,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,My Lady, you do not have to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.59,0:33:57.38,Default,Lady Cui,0,0,0,,A prince dies for his father;
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.68,0:34:00.33,Default,Lady Cui,0,0,0,,a wife dies for her husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.07,0:34:02.76,Default,Lady Cui,0,0,0,,The meanings match.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.09,0:34:08.86,Default,Lady Cui,0,0,0,,Your wife shall go first.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.40,0:34:13.77,Default,Lady Cui,0,0,0,,I will serve you in our next life, my husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.86,0:34:37.77,Default,Sons,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.77,0:34:38.78,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,My Lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.78,0:34:39.82,Default,Sons,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.82,0:34:45.78,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,My Lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.41,0:35:29.23,Default,Liu Shan,0,0,0,,Exit the gates and surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.15,0:35:42.03,Default,Young Sons,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.70,0:35:43.74,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,Stop crying!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.52,0:35:46.37,Default,Oldest Son,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.94,0:35:48.78,Default,Young Sons,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.62,0:35:51.72,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,Come, sons!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.54,0:35:54.36,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,Your father feels ashamed of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.92,0:35:56.97,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,By dragging out an ignoble existence,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.87,0:36:02.60,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,we shame our ancestors,\N the Late Emperor, and the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.69,0:36:05.98,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,Rather than that,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.54,0:36:08.78,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,why not go to the underworld with your father?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.90,0:36:12.92,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,To repay our ancestors
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.60,0:36:17.38,Default,Young Sons,0,0,0,,No, no! Father, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.77,0:36:24.28,Default,Oldest Son,0,0,0,,Father, your son will go with you \Nand die a martyr for the country!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.72,0:36:25.60,Default,Oldest Son,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.92,0:36:39.20,Default,Young Sons,0,0,0,,Father...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.02,0:36:44.03,Default,Young Sons,0,0,0,,Mother...Mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.99,0:36:46.45,Default,Young Sons,0,0,0,,Mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.45,0:36:47.36,Default,Young Sons,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.34,0:37:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,"Spirit Tablet of Liu Bei, Emperor Zhaolie of Han"
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.82,0:37:04.65,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,The Dynasty of Han is doomed.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.41,0:37:08.91,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,The nation and its spirits are doomed.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.08,0:37:12.91,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,Whose fault is this...?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.45,0:37:16.86,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,Whose fault is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.14,0:37:23.70,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,Late Emperor!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.76,0:37:40.69,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,My wife...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.44,0:37:43.82,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,My sons...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.87,0:38:08.04,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,Late Emperor...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.16,0:38:15.82,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,I, Liu Chen, was incapable of defending your legacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.37,0:38:21.65,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,Only through death can I repay my ancestors.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.61,0:38:28.13,Default,Liu Chen,0,0,0,,Late Emperor, may your spirit \Nacknowledge your grandson's loyalty!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.47,0:39:19.99,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,In the first year of the Yanxing era of Shu-Han, 263 CE,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.99,0:39:23.01,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Liu Shan, the Latter Lord, surrendered to Wei.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.76,0:39:30.43,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,After forty-three years and two emperors\N since the Former Lord, Liu Bei, founded it,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.43,0:39:33.36,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Shu-Han fell.

